/*
        Name: Miss Kitty
        Location: New Reno
        Description: Madam of the Cat's Paw.

        Source: decompiled from the Talking Heads (THAT) RPU patch's nckitty.int
                (talking_heads_that_rpu_map_update_patch.dat). No original THAT
                source exists for this build of the script.

           VOCK changes:
             Fixed Node002 greeting for returning prizefighters and porn stars. The
             THAT-RPU build left both branches empty, so the reply id stayed 0
             (8 for a female dude) and Kitty's opening line showed "Error".
             Restored the THAT base-mod values: prizefighter -> 7702/7710,
             porn star -> 7707/7715. No other changes.
*/

